---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Create a Microsoft task and link title, due date, schedule and status both ways

Usage: mxr todo microsoft link [OPTIONS] <TODO_ID>

Arguments:
  <TODO_ID>

Options:
      --fingerprint <FINGERPRINT>  The fingerprint from the exact --dry-run preview you reviewed
      --dry-run                    Show the exact link and shared fields without running ms-todo
      --account <ACCOUNT>          Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>            [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help                       Print help
